# Status: partially active. See team/DECISIONS.md D-L17.
#
# Only @acexode is a real GitHub handle today. The agent entries below are
# COMMENTS, not owner lines, because CODEOWNERS entries naming teams that do not
# exist produce repository warnings and can make pull requests unmergeable once
# "require review from Code Owners" is enabled. When real GitHub teams exist,
# uncomment them.
#
# Note on the review model (DECISION-LOG.md D-A3, answered 2026-09-26): the
# human does not personally review security-critical pull requests; an AI
# reviewer agent opens the PR and the human merges once CI is green. The owner
# lines below therefore serve as routing and audit trail rather than as a
# required human gate. The residual risk is recorded in DECISION-LOG.md.

# Default owner for anything not matched below.
